  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Kallie’s Korner – Stunning WaterColor Family Retreat! 🌿🌊<br><br>Located in the highly sought-after WaterColor neighborhood, Kallie’s Korner is a gorgeous home perfectly integrated into its natural surroundings, offering both leisure and adventure for the whole family. With 4 bedrooms including 2 master suites, hardwood floors throughout, and spacious living areas, this home is ideal for large family getaways while providing plenty of room for kids to play.<br><br>Inside the Home<br><br>Start your mornings on the screened-in porch, sipping coffee while taking in the peaceful surroundings. The open living area features hardwood floors and calming coastal decor, making it the perfect spot to:<br><br>Relax on comfortable seating<br><br>Watch the big game on the large flat-screen TV above the fireplace<br><br>Enjoy a fun board game with family and friends<br><br>The newly remodeled chef’s kitchen is a showstopper, complete with modern appliances, sleek countertops, and an open layout ideal for preparing meals together. The dining area features a large wooden table under a warm, inviting chandelier, perfect for family meals.<br><br>Bedrooms & Comfort<br><br>First Floor Master Suite: King bed with private bath and access to the porch overlooking the fenced backyard and fire pit<br><br>Second Floor Master Suite: King bed with private bath and walk-in shower<br><br>Second Bedroom: Queen bed with private bath<br><br>Bunk Room: Two custom-built twin-over-twin bunk beds with pull-out twin trundle and private bath<br><br>Each bedroom offers comfort and privacy, making it easy for everyone to unwind after a fun-filled day.<br><br>Outdoor Living & Entertainment<br><br>Wrap-around porches on both levels shaded by towering oak trees, offering a secluded forest-like feel<br><br>Fenced backyard with a fire pit and seating for cozy evenings<br><br>4 adult bicycles and a 6-seater golf cart included for exploring WaterColor<br><br>WaterColor Neighborhood Highlights<br><br>WaterColor Beach Club & Camp WaterColor passes included<br><br>Named the #1 family vacation destination in the U.S.<br><br>499-acre coastal resort with pristine sugar-white beaches<br><br>9 swimming pools, championship golf, and miles of bike-friendly paths<br><br>World-class beachside, poolside, and lakeside dining<br><br>Parks, gardens, and scenic footpaths for the whole family<br><br>Explore Seaside just a short walk or bike ride away, where you’ll find restaurants, shops, galleries, and the famous Camp WaterColor Waterpark featuring a lazy river and corkscrew waterslide.<br><br>Parking & Policies<br><br>2 dedicated parking spots, additional parking available in the community<br><br>Pets welcome: Up to 2 dogs, $350 pet fee<br><br>Check-In: 4:00 PM CST | Check-Out: 10:00 AM CST<br><br>Booking: 50% deposit at time of booking; balance due 30 days prior<br><br>Cancellation: See contract for full policy<br><br>Age Requirement: Must be 25+ to rent, 1 adult per 2 minors. Strict family-only policy<br><br>Your Vacation Awaits!<br><br>With luxury, comfort, and prime access to the best of WaterColor, Kallie’s Korner is your ultimate family-friendly getaway. Book today and start creating lifelong memories! 🌴",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Family-Friendly Retreat – Remodeled Kitchen, Bikes & Golf Cart"
        }
      ],
